{"questions":[{"question_id":"RSUl17B4KTBkfgsW","paperTitle":"AIEEE 2003","year":2003,"examDate":2003,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"structure-of-atom","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","topic":"electronic-configuration-and-nodes","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"permalink":"which-one-of-the-following-groupings-represents-a-collection-2003-marks-4-rsul17b4ktbkfgsw.htm","content":"Which one of the following groupings represents a collection of isoelectronic species? (At. nos. : Cs : 55, Br : 35)","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"N<sup>3-</sup>, F<sup>-</sup>, Na<sup>+</sup>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Be, Al<sup>3+</sup>, Cl<sup>-</sup>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Ca<sup>2+</sup>, Cs<sup>+</sup>, Br "},{"identifier":"D","content":"Na<sup>+</sup>, Ca<sup>2+</sup>, Mg<sup>2+</sup>"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"Isoelectronic means those species whose electron number are same.<br><br>\n\n<table class=\"tg\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-88nc\">Species</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-88nc\">Atomic Number</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-88nc\">Electron Number</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-uys7\">N<sup>3-</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-uys7\">7</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-uys7\">7 + 3 = 10</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-uys7\">F<sup>-</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-uys7\">9</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-uys7\">9 + 1 = 10</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">Na<sup>+</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">11</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">11 - 1 = 10</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">Be</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">4</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">4</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">Al<sup>3+</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">13</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">13 - 3 = 10</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">Cl<sup>-</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">17</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">17 + 1 = 8</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">Ca<sup>2+</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">20</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">20 - 2 = 18</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">Cs<sup>+</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">55</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">55 - 1 = 54</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">Br</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">35</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">35</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">Mg<sup>2+</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">12</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">12 -2 = 10</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table> <br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> N<sup>3-</sup>, F<sup>-</sup>, Na<sup>+</sup> "}]}